  "title": "Content Provenance Stamp",
  "description": "Given two pieces of content, computes an exact digest and a whitespace/casing-normalized similarity digest for each, plus a token-overlap Jaccard signal, to demonstrate why provenance systems carry both an exact identifier and a similarity signal. Uses local fingerprints only, not a real IPFS CID or ISCC code. Deterministic, zero external data. Policy Mandate v2.0: content_provenance_stamp_record.",
