  "mcp_tool_definition": {
    "name": "content_provenance_stamp",
    "description": "Given original and variant content, computes exact and normalized-similarity digests plus a token-overlap Jaccard signal, classifying the pair as identical, re-encoded, related, or unrelated. Local fingerprints only; not a real IPFS CID or ISCC code. Deterministic, zero external data.",
